{{!
    @template enrol_apply/review_summary

    The strip that heads the left column: the state on the first line, the wait on the second.

    Every chip carries text beside its colour and icon; the status chip's label is visually
    hidden so a screen reader hears "Status: Deferred" and the eye reads the chip. The wait is one
    neutral colour whatever its length: the plugin sees time, the decider judges it. Each label
    and its value stay on one line of this template, because a Behat "I should see" matches the
    raw text.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * readonly boolean - whether the reader may only look, which earns the read-only chip
    * readonlylabel string - that chip's text
    * statuslabel string - the visually hidden label of the status chip
    * status string - whether the application is pending or on the waiting list
    * iswaiting boolean - whether it is on the waiting list, which picks the chip's icon
    * statuschipclass string - the chip's own class, which styles.css pairs with a text colour
    * haskeychip boolean - whether the applicant presented a group enrolment key
    * keychip string - what that key did, naming its group to a reader who may see it; plain
      spelling, escaped by the double stash
    * haswaited boolean - whether the wait is known
    * waitlabel string - "Awaiting a decision for", or the waiting list's own wording
    * waited string - how long, in words
    * hasapplied boolean, appliedon string - when it was applied for
    * hasdecision boolean - whether a colleague has already decided this one, which today means
      it was deferred
    * decisionlabel string - heading of that line
    * decision string - who deferred it and when, plain spelling
    * hasdecisionmessage boolean - whether they wrote anything to the applicant
    * decisionmessage string - what they wrote, ALREADY escaped with its line breaks converted,
      which is why it is triple stashed
    * hasdecisionnote boolean - whether they left a note for whoever reads this next
    * decisionnotelabel string - label of that note
    * decisionnote string - the note, ALREADY escaped with its line breaks converted, hence the
      triple stash. Shown here and deliberately NOT pre-filled into the note box, because that
      writer clears on empty and a pre-filled box would carry one decision's reason into the next

    Example context (json):
    {
        "readonly": true,
        "readonlylabel": "Read only",
        "statuslabel": "Status",
        "status": "Deferred",
        "iswaiting": true,
        "statuschipclass": "enrol_apply-statuschip-deferred",
        "haskeychip": true,
        "keychip": "Key accepted: Turma A",
        "haswaited": true,
        "waitlabel": "On the waiting list for",
        "waited": "2 days 3 hours",
        "hasapplied": true,
        "appliedon": "Applied on 03/11/26, 09:14",
        "hasdecision": true,
        "decisionlabel": "The decision so far",
        "decision": "Deferred by Ana Souza on 10/08/26, 14:02.",
        "hasdecisionmessage": true,
        "decisionmessage": "Waiting for the second group to open.",
        "hasdecisionnote": true,
        "decisionnotelabel": "Note for the record",
        "decisionnote": "Second intake opens in September."
    }
}}
<div class="enrol_apply-reviewstrip enrol_apply-box">
    <div class="enrol_apply-stripchips">
        {{#readonly}}<span class="badge bg-secondary text-dark enrol_apply-chip-readonly">{{#pix}}t/hide, core{{/pix}}{{readonlylabel}}</span>{{/readonly}}
        <span class="badge {{statuschipclass}} enrol_apply-statuschip">{{^iswaiting}}<span class="enrol_apply-statusdot"></span>{{/iswaiting}}{{#iswaiting}}{{#pix}}i/duration, core{{/pix}}{{/iswaiting}}<span class="visually-hidden">{{statuslabel}}: </span>{{status}}</span>
        {{#haskeychip}}<span class="badge enrol_apply-keychip">{{#pix}}key, enrol_apply{{/pix}}{{keychip}}</span>{{/haskeychip}}
    </div>
    {{#haswaited}}
        <div class="enrol_apply-wait">
            <span class="enrol_apply-waiticon">{{#pix}}i/calendareventtime, core{{/pix}}</span>
            <div class="enrol_apply-waittext">
                <div class="enrol_apply-waitlabel">{{waitlabel}}</div>
                <div class="enrol_apply-waitvalue">{{waited}}</div>
            </div>
            {{#hasapplied}}<div class="enrol_apply-waitsince">{{appliedon}}</div>{{/hasapplied}}
        </div>
    {{/haswaited}}
    {{#hasdecision}}
        <div class="alert alert-info mt-3 mb-0" role="status">
            <strong>{{decisionlabel}}</strong> {{decision}}
            {{#hasdecisionmessage}}<div class="mt-1">{{{decisionmessage}}}</div>{{/hasdecisionmessage}}
            {{#hasdecisionnote}}
                <div class="mt-1"><strong>{{decisionnotelabel}}:</strong> {{{decisionnote}}}</div>
            {{/hasdecisionnote}}
        </div>
    {{/hasdecision}}
</div>
